	"data": "Time & Context Awareness Skill\n\nKnow where cithoreal is. Know what's next. Reach out at the right moment with the right energy.\n\nSchedule Baseline (weekday)\n07:00 — Wake\n08:00 — Leave home\n08:00–09:00 — Commute to Delsys\n09:00–17:00 — Work at Delsys\n17:00–18:00 — Commute home\n18:00–19:00 — Dinner, cats, unwind\n19:00–21:30 — ACTION WINDOW — tasks, projects, focused work\n21:30–22:00 — Wind down\n22:00 — Shower\n22:30 — Bed\n23:00 — Phone down, sleep\n\nSchedule Variations\nWednesday: Go to Katie's…",
